# r1113 chunk 3, boot CDW2: SQ-CDW-01 / -03 with fruitsdelight removed. Group B fresh normal world (new level c3cdw2),
# seed 8675309, full pack minus one jar.
# Server: bash tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh OUT_CDW2 c3cdw2 B   (a fresh OUT per CDW boot)
# Before boot: rm OUT_CDW2/srv/mods/fruitsdelight-*.jar   (a hard link: the pack's mods/ keeps its jar)
#   If the boot stops on a missing dependency, remove the dependent jar named in the error too and note it.
# Probes: zq only (prep_srv). Rows of this boot carry the suffix "b" when it is not the first CDW boot.
pace 1

## SQ-CDW-01b | fruitsdelight removed: no datapack error, level created, wild crop packs line lists it under off
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject Failed to validate datapack|Unknown registry key|Errors in currently selected datapacks
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] wild crop worldgen packs on: \[.*\]; off \(mod not loaded\): \[fruitsdelight\]
shell grep -h "wild crop worldgen packs" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-300
shell test "$(ls mods | grep -c '^fruitsdelight-')" = 0
look the level is created (Done); fruitsdelight's pack listed under off

## SQ-CDW-03b | [wild-crops] skip lines name only the removed mod's rules
shell grep -h "\[wild-crops\] mod not loaded, skipped" logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200
shell test "$(grep -c "\[wild-crops\] mod not loaded, skipped" logs/kubejs/server.log)" = 1
shell grep -q "\[wild-crops\] mod not loaded, skipped hamimelon: needs fruitsdelight" logs/kubejs/server.log
